                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2736d9ab-8c54-3918-8ed2-1f54d18ae54b",
                        "entry_id": "626fd117-e41a-333e-b46f-d789d8116cc4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A cutter, consisting of a blade in either knife form or disk form, attached to the ploughbeam of a plough to cut the sward, in front of the ploughshare and mouldboard."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cbda3584-da49-473b-a3bd-eca6e7bb8d8b",
                                "sense_id": "2736d9ab-8c54-3918-8ed2-1f54d18ae54b",
                                "text": "Holonyms: plough, plow < implement"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "47e5327b-d276-4ca1-8d1b-9a96a700ecb0",
                                "sense_id": "2736d9ab-8c54-3918-8ed2-1f54d18ae54b",
                                "text": "I lately left a furrow, one or twayne, / Unplough'd, the which my coulter hath not cleft […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "da97ff39-82cb-4429-b0e7-90d226c84d12",
                                "sense_id": "2736d9ab-8c54-3918-8ed2-1f54d18ae54b",
                                "text": "What is it but a servitude like that impos'd by the Philistims, not to be allow'd the sharpning of our own axes and coulters, but we must repair from all quarters to twenty licencing forges."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "60038a9b-bcda-4dee-aace-5d1a2d8a1ae8",
                                "sense_id": "2736d9ab-8c54-3918-8ed2-1f54d18ae54b",
                                "text": "With colters bright the rushy sward bisect, / And in new veins the gushing rills direct […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2d343d8c-50a5-3d86-ba89-8274b73eddab",
                        "entry_id": "626fd117-e41a-333e-b46f-d789d8116cc4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The part of a seed drill that makes the furrow for the seed."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "British"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
